# Normalize text to LF in both the index and the working tree.
#
# This is load-bearing, not cosmetic: world packages embed the SHA-256 of file
# bytes. `authoring/worlds/marble-living-cabin/build-package.mjs` hashes
# `assets/collider.glb` and `Presence/ResidentPropPlacementConfiguration.swift`,
# and `apps/macos/Resources/Worlds/marble-living-cabin/world.json` pins the
# SHA-256 of every shipped resource. On a machine with `core.autocrlf=true`, a
# CRLF checkout would invalidate the baked-navigation gate
# ("Baked navigation is stale") on a clean clone.
* text=auto eol=lf

*.spz binary
*.glb binary
*.vmd binary
*.vrma binary
*.png binary
*.jpg binary
*.jpeg binary
*.webp binary
*.icns binary
*.bmp binary
*.pdf binary
*.db binary
